# Python environments and caches
**/.venv*/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
**/.hypothesis/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
